    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Inner Circle Task Force",
    "summary": "During your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase), you may vow to take one **objective**. The **[vowed objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)** designation clears when your next [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) opens. A friendly **DEATHWING INFANTRY** unit adds +1 to **[wound rolls](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls)** when its attack targets an enemy in range of that **objective**. **Restrictions:** **DARK ANGELS** units are permitted. **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** from another Chapter are excluded.",
